  {
   "id": "god-damn-the-garden-185915@post-2022-01-08",
   "gameId": "god-damn-the-garden-185915",
   "displayName": "Title: controller support added",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "inferred",
   "announcedAt": "2022-01-08T12:30:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "patch notes: v1.0.10248062F1, RELEASE v1.0.000000, Expansion count: 0",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Title: Controller added & fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-added controller support. automatically changes to controller or mouse/keyboard ingame based on input",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "-capybara now got courage to join boss fights when it starts",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-increased jump height on leaves a little + made it functional if your FPS is low",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-keybindings didn't load changes when relaunching, until now!!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "new option additions",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "-invert X & Y",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "-auto aim. added it most cus of controller support, but works with mouse/keyboard too if u feel like playing with it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "new",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "-controller sensitivity",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "next on agendaaaa is adding localization, starting with norwegian cus that's the one i speak lol. if u wanna help with adding other languages, feel free to contact me: agelvik.contact@gmail.com, however keep in mind i can't afford paying for ur service since i lack gold for it",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
